    ///   <para>"tendency_of_X" means derivative of X with respect to time.  "troposphere_moles_of_X" means the total number of moles of X contained in the troposphere, i.e, summed over that part of the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.  The chemical formula of carbon monoxide is CO.</para>
