    /// <seealso href="http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#tendency_of_atmosphere_moles_of_nox_expressed_as_nitrogen">http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#tendency_of_atmosphere_moles_of_nox_expressed_as_nitrogen</seealso>
