    /// <seealso href="http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#surface_geostrophic_sea_water_y_velocity">http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#surface_geostrophic_sea_water_y_velocity</seealso>
